# Recommended: leave empty when the Worker is routed on the same domain
# (for example app.example.com/api/* -> careshift-api). Requests stay
# same-origin, so Better Auth cookies work without cross-site configuration.
VITE_API_URL=

# Only for a separate API hostname. Cross-site cookies must be configured;
# same-zone routing is strongly preferred.
# VITE_API_URL=https://careshift-api.example.workers.dev
